<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net">
  <diagram name="Page-1" id="YJpAgO66W75ZW9nsQ11s">
    <mxGraphModel dx="2952" dy="2316" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="850" pageHeight="1100" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\ntitle B2C E-Commerce - Customer Order &amp; Main Warehouse Fulfillment\n\nleft to right direction\n\nskinparam backgroundColor #F8FAFC\nskinparam shadowing false\nskinparam actorStyle awesome\nskinparam roundcorner 20\n\nskinparam packageStyle rectangle\nskinparam packageBackgroundColor #EAF2F8\nskinparam packageBorderColor #647F99\nskinparam packageFontColor #263B50\nskinparam packagePadding 16\nskinparam packageMargin 10\n\nskinparam defaultFontName Arial\nskinparam defaultFontSize 13\nskinparam nodesep 22\nskinparam ranksep 40\n\nskinparam ArrowColor #64748B\nskinparam ArrowThickness 1.2\n\nskinparam UseCaseBackgroundColor #FFFFFF\nskinparam UseCaseBorderColor #647F99\nskinparam UseCaseFontColor #263B50\n\nskinparam ActorBorderColor #334155\nskinparam ActorFontColor #263B50\n\n&#39; Primary Actors (Left Side)\nactor \&quot;Customer\\n(Consumer)\&quot; as Customer\nactor \&quot;Main Warehouse\\nStaff\&quot; as WS\n\nrectangle \&quot;B2C E-Commerce System (Unified Pharmaceutical Platform)\&quot; {\n\n    &#39; Column 1: Customer Shopping, Checkout &amp; AI Assistant\n    together {\n        package \&quot;01 - Product Catalog &amp; Cart (SRS 3.2.3.1)\&quot; as P1 {\n            usecase \&quot;Register / Login &amp;\\nManage Profile\&quot; as UC01\n            usecase \&quot;Validate Customer\\nCredentials &amp; Profile Data\&quot; as UC02\n            usecase \&quot;Browse, Search &amp; Filter\\nProducts by Category\&quot; as UC03\n            usecase \&quot;Check Product Regulatory\\nClassification (OTC vs. Non-OTC)\&quot; as UC04\n            usecase \&quot;View OTC Details,\\nPrices &amp; Availability\&quot; as UC05\n            usecase \&quot;View Non-OTC Products\\n(Name Only - No Price/Cart)\&quot; as UC06\n            usecase \&quot;Manage Shopping Cart\\n(Eligible OTC Only)\&quot; as UC07\n            usecase \&quot;Validate OTC Eligibility &amp;\\nCart Item Stock Limit\&quot; as UC08\n        }\n\n        package \&quot;02 - Checkout &amp; Order Validation (SRS 3.2.3.2)\&quot; as P2 {\n            usecase \&quot;Checkout &amp; Submit Order\&quot; as UC09\n            usecase \&quot;Enter Delivery Details\&quot; as UC10\n            usecase \&quot;Select Payment Method\\n(Visa or Cash on Delivery)\&quot; as UC11\n            usecase \&quot;Validate Order &amp; Check\\nMain Warehouse Stock\&quot; as UC12\n        }\n\n        package \&quot;05 - AI Product Assistance (SRS 3.2.3.3)\&quot; as P5 {\n            usecase \&quot;Inquire About Products\\nvia AI Chatbot\&quot; as UC25\n            usecase \&quot;Retrieve Registered Product\\nDetails, Prices &amp; Stock\&quot; as UC26\n        }\n    }\n\n    &#39; Column 2: Payment Processing, Warehouse &amp; Bosta Shipping\n    together {\n        package \&quot;03 - Payment &amp; Order Confirmation (Visa &amp; COD)\&quot; as P3 {\n            usecase \&quot;Create Pending Order &amp;\\nReserve Stock Quantities\&quot; as UC13\n            usecase \&quot;Request Payment Session &amp;\\nPay via Visa Secure Page\&quot; as UC14\n            usecase \&quot;Verify Payment\&quot; as UC15\n            usecase \&quot;Mark Payment Failed &amp;\\nRelease Reserved Stock\&quot; as UC16\n            usecase \&quot;Confirm Order &amp; Deduct\\nMain Warehouse Stock\&quot; as UC17\n            usecase \&quot;Process Cash on Delivery\\n(COD Order Approval)\&quot; as UC18\n        }\n\n        package \&quot;04 - Warehouse Fulfillment &amp; Bosta Delivery\&quot; as P4 {\n            usecase \&quot;View Confirmed B2C Orders\&quot; as UC19\n            usecase \&quot;Pick, Check &amp; Pack\\nProducts\&quot; as UC20\n            usecase \&quot;Create Bosta Shipment &amp;\\nReceive Tracking\&quot; as UC21\n           \n\n            usecase \&quot;Track Shipment &amp; View\\nOrder History\&quot; as UC24\n        }\n    }\n}\n\n&#39; Secondary / External Actors (Right Side)\nactor \&quot;Payment Gateway\\n(Visa Provider)\&quot; as PG\nactor \&quot;Bosta Shipping\\nAPI\&quot; as Bosta\nactor \&quot;AI Chatbot\\nService\&quot; as AI\n\n&#39; Hidden links to align Column 1 and Column 2 neatly side-by-side\nUC06 -[hidden]-&gt; UC13\nUC11 -[hidden]-&gt; UC19\n\n&#39; =========================\n&#39; 01 - Catalog &amp; Cart Links (With Validations)\n&#39; =========================\nCustomer --&gt; UC01\nCustomer --&gt; UC03\nCustomer --&gt; UC07\n\nUC01 ..&gt; UC02 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC03 ..&gt; UC04 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC04 &lt;.. UC05 : &lt;&lt;extend&gt;&gt;\\n[If OTC]\nUC04 &lt;.. UC06 : &lt;&lt;extend&gt;&gt;\\n[If Non-OTC]\nUC07 ..&gt; UC08 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\n\n&#39; =========================\n&#39; 02 - Checkout Links\n&#39; =========================\nCustomer --&gt; UC09\n\nUC09 ..&gt; UC10 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC09 ..&gt; UC11 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC09 ..&gt; UC12 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\n\n&#39; =========================\n&#39; 03 - Visa vs. COD Payment Links\n&#39; =========================\nUC11 &lt;.. UC13 : &lt;&lt;extend&gt;&gt;\\n[Method = Visa]\nUC13 ..&gt; UC14 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC14 ..&gt; UC15 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC14 --&gt; PG\nPG --&gt; UC15\n\nUC15 &lt;.. UC17 : &lt;&lt;extend&gt;&gt;\\n[Payment Paid]\nUC15 &lt;.. UC16 : &lt;&lt;extend&gt;&gt;\\n[Payment Failed]\n\nUC11 &lt;.. UC18 : &lt;&lt;extend&gt;&gt;\\n[Method = COD]\nUC18 ..&gt; UC17 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\n\n&#39; =========================\n&#39; 04 - Warehouse &amp; Bosta Links\n&#39; =========================\nWS --&gt; UC19\nWS --&gt; UC20\n\nUC20 ..&gt; UC21 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC21 --&gt; Bosta\n\n\nCustomer --&gt; UC24\n\n&#39; =========================\n&#39; 05 - AI Chatbot Links\n&#39; =========================\nCustomer --&gt; UC25\nUC25 ..&gt; UC26 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC26 --&gt; AI\n\n&#39; =========================\n&#39; SRS &amp; Business Notes\n&#39; =========================\nnote bottom of P1\n  Regulatory Constraint (SRS 2.4 &amp; 3.2.3.1):\n  Non-OTC medications display Product Name ONLY\n  without prices, descriptions, or cart options.\nend note\n\nnote bottom of P5\n  AI Safety Guardrail (SRS 3.2.3.3):\n  Answers inquiries using live database stock/prices,\n  but strictly DOES NOT provide medical diagnoses.\nend note\n\n@enduml&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="zq6nTFmmO8eTO66t7mxv-1">
          <mxCell connectable="0" parent="1" style="group;transparentBounds=1;editIcon=1;lockedGroup=0;groupPadding=0 10 10 10;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
